.TH "nvme_init_get_features_fdp_events" 9 "nvme_init_get_features_fdp_events" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_features_fdp_events \- Initialize passthru command for Get Features - Flexible Data Placement Events
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_features_fdp_events
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "enum nvme_get_features_sel sel "  ","
.BI "__u16 phndl "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select which type of attribute to return,
see \fIenum nvme_get_features_sel\fP
.IP "phndl" 12
Placement Handle (PHNDL)
.IP "data" 12
Supported FDP Event Type List data buffer, see \fIstruct
nvme_fdp_supported_event_desc\fP
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_FDP_EVENTS
